NOTICE OF PROHIBITION — IMPURE WORLD REINCARNATION (EDO TENSEI)
By order of the Hokage's Office

Technique: Impure World Reincarnation (Edo Tensei)
Nature: Forbidden Kinjutsu — reanimation
Origin: Devised by the Second Hokage, Tobirama Senju, and sealed away.

Prohibition: This technique reanimates the dead by binding a soul to a
living sacrifice, producing a near-immortal, controllable body. Its
practice is ABSOLUTELY FORBIDDEN within Konohagakure and by any of its
shinobi. The desecration of the fallen and the enslavement of a living
vessel are crimes of the highest order.

Enforcement: Possession, study, or use of this technique constitutes an
S-rank offense. The technique is known to have been perfected and abused
by the defector Orochimaru. Any recovered materials are to be surrendered
to the forbidden archive under the Hokage's seal.

This notice is affixed to the Scroll of Seals inventory. Do not attempt.
